Local changes: Linux uses the maintained zbus 6 async API with explicit connection/runtime cleanup.
The published Windows/macOS implementations and public API/features are preserved.
Private D-Bus integration checks exercise delivery, errors and resource lifetime.
Package metadata, manifest dependencies, documentation and Linux tests are adapted for this workspace.
Remove this local copy when an official Tauri 2 compatible release uses maintained zbus and passes
these same delivery/lifetime checks. No RustSec advisory suppression is used.
